    {
      "language": "en",
      "status": "official",
      "text": "section 199A(e)(2)(A): the threshold amount for a return other than a joint return (,500 statutory, taxable years beginning after 2018 indexed). For 2026 the Revenue Procedure lists a separate figure for married individuals filing separately (,775); this parameter is the all-other-returns figure (TECH-GAPS G2772). Taxable years 2019-2024 are gaps (their Revenue Procedures are not pinned): MISSING_PARAMETER_VALUE (TECH-GAPS G2772)."
    }
